@startuml External-Service State Machine
[*] --> Idle

state "Idle (Home Screen)" as Idle
state "Form Ready" as FormReady
state "Submitting" as Submitting
state "Success Display" as Success
state "Error Display" as ErrorDisplay
state "Network Error" as NetworkError

Idle --> FormReady : User clicks\n"Create Order"
FormReady --> Submitting : User submits form\n(loading = true)

Submitting --> Success : HTTP 200/201\nOrder created
Submitting --> ErrorDisplay : HTTP 400/500\nValidation/Server error
Submitting --> NetworkError : Network failure\n(ERR_NETWORK)

Success --> Idle : User navigates home
ErrorDisplay --> FormReady : User corrects form
NetworkError --> FormReady : User retries

note right of Submitting
  POST to:
  http://localhost:8080/
  api/v1/orchestrator/orders

  Body: {
    title, author, pages,
    coverType, pageType,
    quantity
  }
end note

note right of Success
  Displays:
  - Order ID
  - Full response JSON
  - Form reset
end note

@enduml
